      "title": "One Nation to establish headquarters in multimillion-dollar Brisbane office bought by Gina Rinehart",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/05/brisbane-one-nation-office-multimillion-gina-rinehart-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Barnaby Joyce defends move, saying party will lease space from mining billionaire’s company at commercial rates</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/05/one-nation-1998-queensland-election-pauline-hanson-david-oldfield-ntwnfb\">One Nation celebrated stunning success in Queensland in 1998 – then it all fell apart. What happened?</a></p></li><li><p>Listen to episode 4 of <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/oct/05/the-populist-the-social-contract-episode-4-podcast-ntwnfb\">The Populist podcast</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Barnaby Joyce has defended One Nation’s plan to move its headquarters to a multimillion-dollar Brisbane office building bought by the mining billionaire Gina Rinehart.</p><p>The One Nation MP said the party’s national head office would pay the market rate to Rinehart’s company to rent the space, claiming there would be no mate’s rates.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/05/brisbane-one-nation-office-multimillion-gina-rinehart-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
