      "description": "<p>Officers were responding to reports a car had driven into a tree 84km north of Yass on Sunday</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A man has been shot dead by police in regional <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/new-south-wales\">New South Wales</a> after allegedly aiming a loaded rifle at officers responding to a car crash.</p><p>NSW police were responding to reports that a car had driven into a tree on a road 84km north of Yass about 2.50pm on Sunday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/05/man-shot-dead-nsw-police-yass-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
